{"route":"/docs/6.0/components/avatar/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Avatar","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for avatars, including image avatars, initials, status indicators, and avatar stacks."},"blocks":[{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"examples--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Avatars are used to represent users or entities. They can display an image or initials as a fallback."},{"id":"image","type":"heading","en":"Image","level":3},{"id":"image--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>.avatar</code> with an <code>.avatar-img</code> for image-based avatars. The parent <code>.avatar</code> element provides an easy wrapper for additional avatar features like status indicators and stacks. You’re welcome to use the <code>.avatar-img</code> class on its own if you only need a single HTML element."},{"id":"image--example-1","type":"demo","key":"168ceb27164882240acb","height":147},{"id":"image--code-1","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>","language":""},{"id":"image--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"When used inside the <code>.avatar</code> wrapper, the image fills the wrapper and its size is set with <code>--avatar-size</code>. Used on its own, <code>.avatar-img</code> honors its own <code>width</code> and <code>height</code> instead, so set them to your desired size."},{"id":"image--example-2","type":"demo","key":"042b1718d576c4108618","height":147},{"id":"image--code-2","type":"code","value":"<img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">","language":""},{"id":"initials","type":"heading","en":"Initials","level":3},{"id":"initials--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use text content inside <code>.avatar</code> for initials-based avatars."},{"id":"initials--example-1","type":"demo","key":"704adcfcebde9c59f27d","height":300},{"id":"initials--code-1","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"avatar\">AB</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-primary\">CD</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-accent\">EF</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-success\">GG</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-danger\">GH</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-warning\">IJ</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-info\">KL</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-inverse\">MN</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-secondary\">OP</span>","language":""},{"id":"initials--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>.avatar-subtle</code> to create a subtle avatar."},{"id":"initials--example-2","type":"demo","key":"6880f444bb044e8aecde","height":300},{"id":"initials--code-2","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"avatar\">AB</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-primary\">CD</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-accent\">EF</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-success\">GG</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-danger\">GH</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-warning\">IJ</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-info\">KL</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-inverse\">MN</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-subtle theme-secondary\">OP</span>","language":""},{"id":"sizes","type":"heading","en":"Sizes","level":2},{"id":"sizes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Avatars come in multiple sizes: extra small, small, default, large, and extra large."},{"id":"sizes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c26acfb8e09cc86073fb","height":300},{"id":"sizes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"avatar avatar-xs\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-sm\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-lg\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-xl\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>","language":""},{"id":"sizes--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Use a custom size by modifying the <code>--bs-avatar-size</code> variable."},{"id":"sizes--example-2","type":"demo","key":"f628c8ef678ec14dfee6","height":147},{"id":"sizes--code-2","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"avatar\" style=\"--bs-avatar-size: 8rem;\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>","language":""},{"id":"status-indicator","type":"heading","en":"Status indicator","level":2},{"id":"status-indicator--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add a <code>.avatar-status</code> element inside the avatar to show a status indicator. Each status has a distinct shape and color:"},{"id":"status-indicator--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"status-indicator--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>.status-online</code> — green circle"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"status-indicator--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>.status-offline</code> — gray rounded square"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"status-indicator--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>.status-busy</code> — red rounded square"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"status-indicator--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>.status-away</code> — yellow circle"}]}]},{"id":"status-indicator--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Because the status is conveyed purely through color and shape, give each <code>.avatar-status</code> a <code>role=&quot;img&quot;</code> and an <code>aria-label</code> (e.g. <code>Online</code>) so assistive technologies can announce it."},{"id":"status-indicator--example-1","type":"demo","key":"ed4abe2c8a2016666caa","height":228},{"id":"status-indicator--code-1","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-online\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Online\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-offline\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Offline\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-busy\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Busy\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-away\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Away\"></span>\n</span>","language":""},{"id":"status-with-sizes","type":"heading","en":"Status with sizes","level":3},{"id":"status-with-sizes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The status indicator scales with the avatar size."},{"id":"status-with-sizes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"68e85dedfa9e3e7b573e","height":300},{"id":"status-with-sizes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<span class=\"avatar avatar-xs\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-online\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Online\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-sm\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-online\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Online\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-online\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Online\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-lg\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-online\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Online\"></span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"avatar avatar-xl\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  <span class=\"avatar-status status-online\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Online\"></span>\n</span>","language":""},{"id":"avatar-stack","type":"heading","en":"Avatar stack","level":2},{"id":"avatar-stack--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>.avatar-stack</code> to group multiple avatars together with overlapping effect. Avatars are rendered in reverse order so the first avatar appears on top. Stacks use a percentage of the avatar size to determine how much to overlap stacked avatars."},{"id":"avatar-stack--example-1","type":"demo","key":"0c010fdd9c513cec11a4","height":147},{"id":"avatar-stack--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"avatar-stack\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"stack-with-sizes","type":"heading","en":"Stack with sizes","level":3},{"id":"stack-with-sizes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"As a shorthand, size classes are available for <code>.avatar-stack</code> and <code>.avatar</code>."},{"id":"stack-with-sizes--example-1","type":"demo","key":"84a19a6bc92093111111","height":300},{"id":"stack-with-sizes--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"avatar-stack avatar-stack-xs\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"avatar-stack avatar-stack-sm\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"avatar-stack\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"avatar-stack avatar-stack-lg\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"avatar-stack avatar-stack-xl\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"stack-with-count","type":"heading","en":"Stack with count","level":3},{"id":"stack-with-count--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Combine with initials to show a count of additional users."},{"id":"stack-with-count--example-1","type":"demo","key":"f3caa90ca2a94a2b85c0","height":147},{"id":"stack-with-count--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"avatar-stack\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar theme-secondary\">+5</span>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"stack-with-count--example-2","type":"demo","key":"693f8e2fc584c44b9097","height":147},{"id":"stack-with-count--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"avatar-stack avatar-stack-xl\">\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar\">\n    <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"avatar theme-secondary\">+5</span>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Avatar use local CSS variables on <code>.avatar</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$avatar-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --avatar-size: 2.5rem,\n    --avatar-border-radius: 50%,\n    --avatar-border-width: 2px,\n    --avatar-border-color: var(--bg-body),\n    --avatar-bg: var(--bg-2),\n    --avatar-color: var(--fg-body),\n    // --avatar-font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium), // Defaults to fallback\n    --avatar-status-size: .75rem,\n    --avatar-status-border-width: 2px,\n    --avatar-status-border-color: var(--bg-body),\n    --avatar-stack-spacing: -.3,\n    --avatar-stack-transition: \"transform .2s ease-in-out\",\n  ),\n  $avatar-tokens\n);","language":""},{"id":"sass-maps","type":"heading","en":"Sass maps","level":3},{"id":"sass-maps--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Avatar sizes are defined in the <code>$avatar-sizes</code> Sass map. Each size specifies the avatar size and status size."},{"id":"sass-maps--code-1","type":"code","value":"$avatar-sizes: ();\n// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$avatar-sizes: defaults(\n  (\n    \"xs\": (\n      size: 1.5rem,\n      status-size: .625rem,\n    ),\n    \"sm\": (\n      size: 2rem,\n    ),\n    \"lg\": (\n      size: 3rem,\n      status-size: 1rem,\n      border-width: 3px,\n    ),\n    \"xl\": (\n      size: 4rem,\n      status-size: 1.25rem,\n      border-width: 4px,\n    ),\n  ),\n  $avatar-sizes\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"168ceb27164882240acb","html":"<span class=\"avatar\">\n  <img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\">\n</span>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"042b1718d576c4108618","html":"<img class=\"avatar-img\" src=\"https://github.com/mdo.png\" alt=\"mdo\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\">","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"704adcfcebde9c59f27d","html":"<span class=\"avatar\">AB</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-primary\">CD</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-accent\">EF</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-success\">GG</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-danger\">GH</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-warning\">IJ</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-info\">KL</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-inverse\">MN</span>\n<span class=\"avatar theme-secondary\">OP</span>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"6880f444bb044e8aecde","html":"<span class=\"avatar\">AB</